# Project Overview: Steacher

**Steacher** is a web-based educational platform for interactive exercises and AI-assisted learning. It uses a Django 5 backend with PostgreSQL, a modern TypeScript + Vue 3 multi-page frontend, and integrates LLMs (primarily Google Gemini, with OpenAI support) to guide learners through a Socratic approach.

